Abstract = {This paper presents a novel, low-cost, and accessible AI-based quality
   control test bench solution for the textile industry. It is especially
   designed for small and medium-sized enterprises. Using available
   consumer hardware and innovative AI techniques, the proposed system
   offers highly accurate quality control without significant financial
   investment. The developed software libraries, hardware documentation,
   and design are published as open-source projects on GitHub. The proposed
   approach is intended to empower small and medium-sized enterprises to
